stem_md:
5. (Nguyen Trung Kien, CPR) 设 $a, b, c$ 是正实数, 证明:
(1) $\frac{a^3}{b} + \frac{b^3}{c} + \frac{c^3}{a} \geqslant \sqrt{3(a^4+b^4+c^4)}$;
(2) $\frac{a^4}{b} + \frac{b^4}{c} + \frac{c^4}{a} \geqslant \sqrt{3(a^6+b^6+c^6)}$;
(3) 证明下列不等式不成立
$$
\frac{a^5}{b} + \frac{b^5}{c} + \frac{c^5}{a} \geqslant \sqrt{3(a^8+b^8+c^8)}
$$

original_text_md:
